args: opentide migrate vocab-scope --help
exit: 0

━━━ stdout
Re-prefix stage-scoped vocabulary values (`Process` -> `Host::Process`).

Applies only mechanical outcomes: a key defined under exactly one stage,
and a stage whose casing drifted. A key defined under several stages is
reported, never guessed. Exits 2 when anything is left for a human.

␛[1m␛[4mUsage:␛[0m ␛[1mopentide migrate vocab-scope␛[0m [OPTIONS]

␛[1m␛[4mOptions:␛[0m
      ␛[1m--apply␛[0m
          Rewrite the objects (default: dry-run report)

      ␛[1m--field␛[0m <FIELD>
          Limit to one scoped field (repeatable). Default: every scoped field.

      ␛[1m--force␛[0m
          Exit 0 even when values need a human decision

      ␛[1m--help␛[0m
          Print help

Examples:
  $ opentide migrate vocab-scope
  $ opentide migrate vocab-scope --apply

━━━ stderr · empty
